      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Cursor CLI and Amp need nothing more once Claude Code has the plugin.\nGrok Build loads nothing from it and needs its own install.\nEach tool updates the same way it installed.",
